msgstr "GMEOW 记忆记录模块"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/memory-records|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/sliceConsumer"
msgid "Agent memory adapters preserving revision lineage, audience scope and attributed source evidence."
msgstr "保留修订沿袭、受众范围及归属来源证据的代理记忆适配器。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/MemoryTextLanguageConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
